From: ReiKatari <reikatari@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:05:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/10] turnip: Enable VK_EXT_depth_range_unrestricted

Allows negative and greater-than-one depth ranges for infinite projection
matrices and mirror planar reflections in switch emulators.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_extensions.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_extensions.py b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_extensions.py
index abcdef1..2345678 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_extensions.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_extensions.py
@@ -140,6 +140,8 @@ EXTENSIONS = [
     Extension("VK_EXT_depth_range_unrestricted", 1, "device->info->a6xx || device->info->a7xx || device->info->a8xx"),
 ]
